        "title": "Planning After a Dementia Diagnosis",
        "author": "National Institute on Aging",
        "summary": "Official patient and caregiver guidance explaining early health, legal, financial, long-term-care, and end-of-life planning while the person can express preferences. This resource supports informed conversations with qualified clinicians, identifies practical care questions, and helps pastoral caregivers avoid replacing medical judgment with unsupported advice.",
        "url": "https://www.nia.nih.gov/health/legal-and-financial-planning-people-alzheimers"
