    "safety": "Pornography involving minors, nonconsensual or secretly recorded material, image-based abuse, trafficking, voyeurism, coercion, credible contact risk, or other illegal conduct requires immediate safeguarding and appropriate civil reporting. Do not delete, forward, download, or investigate suspected illegal material yourself; preserve available identifying information without increasing possession and contact law enforcement or the designated reporting authority. Remove the person from unsupervised access to potential victims when facts indicate risk. A spouse must never be required to monitor devices, absorb graphic disclosures, provide sex, or remain in an unsafe setting as proof of forgiveness. Assess suicidality, violence, retaliation, stalking, financial depletion, and child access when exposure or separation may trigger crisis. Accountability software is one layer of support, not a substitute for competent risk assessment, church discipline, professional treatment, restitution, or legal consequences.",
