    "safety": "When favoritism conceals abuse, financial misconduct, discrimination, retaliation, child endangerment, or criminal conduct, move beyond informal counseling to the appropriate safeguarding, civil, legal, employment, or denominational process. Protect complainants and witnesses from retaliation, preserve records lawfully, disclose conflicts of interest, and use independent investigators where required. Forgiveness language must not be used to restore unsafe access or evade consequences.",
