    "safety": "Overt narcissistic patterns can coexist with severe coercive control and lethality risk. Screen privately for escalating threats, strangulation history, weapon access, forced sex, stalking, surveillance, financial captivity, dangerous driving, property destruction, threats involving children or pets, suicidal or homicidal intent, and separation-related escalation. Do not notify the alleged offender of a disclosure or safety plan without the victim's informed agreement and qualified guidance. Preserve evidence, document exact words, follow mandatory-reporting law, and involve emergency services, law enforcement, medical care, domestic-violence advocacy, child protection, or legal counsel as facts require. Marriage counseling, mediation, informal confrontation, and church-managed investigation are not substitutes for safety or civil process. A man's office, reputation, generosity, or doctrinal orthodoxy must not purchase institutional protection.",
